blurb: The South Portland School Board held a workshop to discuss the future of the
  SPHS Athletic Complex, debating the merits of natural grass versus artificial turf,
  including environmental, health, and usability concerns. The Superintendent presented
  a new, scaled-back proposal for the complex, aiming for reduced synthetic turf and
  lower costs.
