    text: Ms. Ryan asks if Wainwright fields would still close when it rains, even
      with lights. Mr. Peruzzi confirms that due to the high water table and groundwater
      issues, Wainwright fields would still be susceptible to closure during heavy
      rain, regardless of lighting.
