- time: 01:18:35
  seconds: 7115
  topic: 'Citizen Group Presentation: Defend Our Health (Sarah Woodbury)'
  desc: Sarah Woodbury, Vice President of Policy and Advocacy for Defend Our Health,
    presents concerns about artificial turf. She details the toxic chemicals (phthalates,
    lead, mercury, PFAS) found in turf, their health impacts, and challenges the claim
